  "body_html": "<h1>not_mem_paretoDomSet_of_strict</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma not_mem_paretoDomSet_of_strict [Fintype N] [Fintype G] (v : Valuation N G) (A A' : Allocation N G) (_hweak : ∀ i : N, v.val i (A i) ≤ v.val i (A' i)) (hstrict : ∃ j : N, v.val j (A j) &lt; v.val j (A' j)) : A ∉ Finset.univ.filter (fun B : N → Finset G =&gt; ∀ i : N, v.val i (A' i) ≤ v.val i (B i))</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Valuation</li>\n<li>Allocation</li>\n</ul>",
